# Control Tower F1's four boxes: ObjType_Events $13-$16, loc_DC1E
# (ps2.asm:20171), Obj_InvisibleBlock2 ($38) at x 656, 720, 784, 848 and
# y 96 -- cells 40-41, 44-45, 48-49, 52-53 on row 6. No d2 test: with
# the event's flag clear, loc_E84A with item event - $E, the Green,
# Blue, Yellow and Red cards; set, $1708. Before build 73 each was
# $1708 and "... is not ported" on stderr.

start level $3F 40 7
wait idle
press up
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1702
expect script $1703
shot 01_green
press c
wait idle
expect item GreenCard
walk right 4
wait idle
press up
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1703
press c
wait idle
expect item BlueCard
walk right 4
wait idle
press up
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1703
press c
wait idle
expect item YellowCard
walk right 4
wait idle
press up
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1703
shot 02_red
press c
wait idle
expect item RedCard
press a
wait idle
expect script $1708
press c
wait idle
expect no-stderr not ported
